  "notes": "Source table is Exhibit E on page 38, showing Service Retirement Annuities. The table provides single-year age data for counts and total annual payments. The target grid requires 5-year age bands, which are derived by summing the single-year rows for ages 50-84. The 'AverageBenefit' is calculated as the ratio of Total Annual Payments to Total Count. The source data is already in annual dollars, so no annualization is needed. Rows for 'UNDER 50' are excluded as they do not fit the target grid (50+). The '100+' row maps to '100 & over'.",
